/-
  NockvmE2E/Exec/J8Chips.lean   (hop 0 of the tie; Mathlib-free, total, GENERATED literals + a Bool check)

  The 12 expected VERIFIER chips (`VC.verifierChipT` of the emitted chip) of the J-8 batch, as `Tr.Chip` literals:
    compute, cell, atom, jet,
    walkChipJ8 at kroots 1, 9, 25, 42, 48, 174 (toy1/cnt/eq5/mat, add, mul, dec, ack, fib),
    walkChipHQK at krootsV 1, 2,
  plus `jDers` / `jMeta` (the derived-slot and coin tables of `j8_atomChipHQL.json`, the `ders`/`meta` argument of `verifierChipT`).
  Generated by scratch `gen.lean` (lake env lean --run): loads the emitted chip JSON (`lean-emit/emitted` = `nockvm-air/tests/fixtures/emitted`, the
  `*.air.json` of the run for the walk numerals) and applies `verifierChipT`.  The kernel tie to the Lean emitter is `Exec/J8ChipsK.lean`.
  `chipsOk X`: every loaded table's chip equals (`chipEqB`: id, shared, cons (kind, round, deg, e), colRound, baseCols, width; the `sharedK`/`consK` tags are
  ignored: the verifier never reads them) one of the literals of its id.  `chipNumeral c` = the numeral of the matching literal.
-/
